    "## 1. Data loading\n",
    "\n",
    "Images are JPEGs, mostly RGB — convert to grayscale on load. Image dimensions vary by LED type (200×200 up to 300×300) but are **consistent within a type**, which is all that matters for reference-image averaging.\n",
    "\n",
    "Filename example: `XRay_FC-SP3_SAC105_Panel1_LED01_0000TSC.jpg` → metadata parsed into (`led_type`, `paste`, `panel`, `led_num`, `tsc`)."
   ]
