   "source": [
    "### Validation against `Xray Void Ratio.csv`\n",
    "\n",
    "The CSV holds the paper's own result for every LED (pad pixels, void count, void pixels, void ratio); its per-type means are exactly Table III of Part I. Each point below is one LED: our void ratio against the CSV value."
   ]
  },
