   "source": [
    "## 8. Sanity checks\n",
    "\n",
    "- `has_thermal_pad = 1` for 3-pad LED types, 0 for FC-SP1 / FC-SP2 / FC-GB3\n",
    "- Total void area fraction distribution — Part I reported ~4% average under vacuum reflow, so this should be heavily right-skewed with a low mean\n",
    "- Per-paste comparison: Part I Table III shows FC-GB3 has the highest voiding (~5.3%); our thermal-pad void fraction should trend the same way"
